~ shadow_wizards
ShadowWizardA: Yo! Check it out, [color=#aa5448]Hotdog[/color]!
ShadowWizardA: A rat, a slime, AND an [color=yellow]angel[/color]?
ShadowWizardA: That's my [color=darkgreen]dream blunt rotation[/color]!
ShadowWizardB: AYO!!! THAT'S RADDD, [color=#6986c2]BLUEBERRY[/color]!!!
do Methods.current_scene.cam.shake()
ShadowWizardB: BUT BROTHA, AIN'T [color=#6a49e7]THE SHADOW GOVERNMENT[/color] BEEN SAYING,
do Methods.current_scene.cam.shake()
ShadowWizardB: THEY BE CLASSIFYIN' ANGELS AS MONSTERS NOW???
Angel: [color=#fff6ad][color=#6a49e7]They[/color] are lying to you, dear.[/color]
Angel: [color=#fff6ad]There's nothing monstrous about me.[/color]
ShadowWizardA: Damn, no cap, OG?? That's a bummer.
ShadowWizardA: If we don't follow the contract and [color=#befff2c]ice[/color] all the monsters...
ShadowWizardA: We won't be getting no nuclear bombs!
do Methods.current_scene.cam.shake()
ShadowWizardB: [color=#6a49e7]THE GOVERNMENT[/color] SURE IS CRUEL!!! BUT THIS DUNGEON'S OURS NOW, BUDDY!!!
Slime: blob
ShadowWizardA: It's bout time we [color=cyan]slime[/color] you out, kiddo!!
=> END

